{
  "id": "143589",
  "url": "https://useme.com/pl/jobs/mern-stack-developer-for-building-saas-platform,143589/",
  "title": "MERN Stack Developer For Building SaaS platform",
  "fields": {
    "Zleceniodawca": "Alina Drozdyk",
    "Opis": "We're looking for an experienced Senior MERN Stack Developer to join our team and work on scalable, high-performance web applications and enterprise-level software solutions.\n\n- Location: Remote / Flexible\n\n- Experience: 5–8 Years\n\nRequired Skills:\n\n- Strong experience with MongoDB, Express.js, React.js, and Node.js (MERN Stack)\n\n- Advanced JavaScript / TypeScript development\n\n- Experience building scalable RESTful APIs and backend services\n\n- Strong knowledge of React.js, Hooks, State Management (Redux/Zustand/Context API)\n\n- Experience with Node.js, Express.js, and API architecture\n\n- Database design and optimization with MongoDB\n\n- Experience with HTML5, CSS3, Tailwind CSS, and modern frontend practices\n\n- Knowledge of authentication, authorization, and security best practices\n\n- Experience with Git, CI/CD, and Agile development workflows\n\nWhat We're Looking For:\n\n- Strong problem-solving and analytical skills\n\n- Ability to design and develop clean, maintainable, and scalable code\n\n- Experience working in Agile/Scrum environments\n\n- Excellent communication and collaboration skills\n\n- Self-driven mindset with attention to quality and technical excellence\n\n- Ability to mentor junior developers and contribute to architectural decisions",
    "Opublikowano": "2026-09-01",
    "Kategoria": "Strony internetowe",
    "Prawa autorskie": "Decyzja freelancera",
    "Wymagane funkcje": "We need a full-stack MERN developer to build a SaaS platform similar to PayKickstart.\n\nThe platform should include:\n\n- User authentication and account management\n- Multi-user roles and permissions\n- SaaS dashboard with analytics and reporting\n- Product/service management\n- Customer management (CRM-style features)\n- Subscription management\n- One-time and recurring payment support\n- Stripe/payment gateway integration\n- Checkout flow and customizable checkout pages\n- Order and transaction management\n- Invoice and billing history\n- API integration capabilities\n- Admin dashboard for managing users, products, payments, and system settings\n- Email notifications and automated workflows\n- Responsive UI for desktop and mobile\n\nTechnical requirements:\n- React / Next.js frontend\n- Node.js + Express backend\n- MongoDB database\n- REST API architecture\n- Secure authentication and authorization\n- Clean, scalable, production-ready code",
    "Preferowane rozwiązanie": "We prefer a custom MERN stack solution built from scratch rather than using WordPress, Shopify, or other ready-made platforms.\n\nThe ideal solution should be:\n\n- Modern SaaS architecture\n- Scalable and maintainable\n- Component-based React frontend\n- Well-structured Node.js backend\n- Secure API design\n- Cloud-ready deployment\n- Easy to extend with future features\n\nThe developer should provide clean code, documentation, and collaborate with our team during the development process.",
    "Umiejętności": "Express.js MongoDB NodeJS moduł płatności React",
    "Budżet": "10000,00 USD",
    "Ważne przez": "60 dni"
  },
